[
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P1-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P1-S1",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "To paraphrase 18th-century statesman Edmund Burke, \"all that is needed for the triumph of a misguided cause is that good people do nothing.\" One such cause now seeks to end biomedical research because of the theory that animals have rights ruling out their use in research.",
    "translation": "用 18 世纪政治家埃德蒙·伯克的话来说，“要让被误导的事业取得胜利，所需要的只是好人什么也不做。”现在，这样的原因之一就是寻求结束生物医学研究，因为动物有权排除其在研究中的使用。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P1-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P1-S2",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Scientists need to respond forcefully to animal rights advocates, whose arguments are confusing the public and thereby threatening advances in health knowledge and care.",
    "translation": "科学家需要对动物权利倡导者做出强有力的回应，他们的论点让公众感到困惑，从而威胁到健康知识和护理的进步。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P1-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P1-S3",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Leaders of the animal rights movement target biomedical research because it depends on public funding, and few people understand the process of health care research.",
    "translation": "动物权利运动的领导人瞄准生物医学研究，因为它依赖公共资金，而且很少有人了解医疗保健研究的过程。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P1-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P1-S4",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Hearing allegations of cruelty to animals in research settings, many are perplexed that anyone would deliberately harm an animal. For example, a grandmotherly woman staffing an animal rights booth at a recent street fair was distributing a brochure that encouraged readers not to use anything that comes from or is tested in animals—no meat, no fur, no medicines.",
    "translation": "听到有关在研究环境中虐待动物的指控，许多人对有人会故意伤害动物感到困惑。例如，在最近的街头集市上，一位在动物权利摊位工作的老奶奶正在分发一本小册子，鼓励读者不要使用任何来自动物或经过动物测试的东西——没有肉、没有皮毛、没有药物。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P1-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P1-S5",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Asked if she opposed immunizations, she wanted to know if vaccines come from animal research.",
    "translation": "当被问及是否反对免疫接种时，她想知道疫苗是否来自动物研究。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P2-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P2-S1",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "When assured that they do, she replied, \"Then I would have to say yes.\" Asked what will happen when epidemics return, she said, \"Don't worry, scientists will find some way of using computers.\" Such well-meaning people just don't understand.",
    "translation": "当确信他们会这样做时，她回答说：“那我就不得不答应了。”当被问及流行病卷土重来时会发生什么时，她说：“别担心，科学家会找到一些使用计算机的方法。”这么好心的人就是不明白。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P2-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P2-S2",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Scientists must communicate their message to the public in a compassionate, understandable way—in human terms, not in the language of molecular biology.",
    "translation": "科学家必须以一种富有同情心、易于理解的方式向公众传达他们的信息——用人类的语言，而不是分子生物学的语言。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P2-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P2-S3",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "We need to make clear the connection between animal research and a grandmother's hip replacement, a father's bypass operation, a baby's vaccinations, and even a pet's shots.",
    "translation": "我们需要弄清楚动物研究与祖母的髋关节置换术、父亲的搭桥手术、婴儿的疫苗接种，甚至宠物的注射之间的联系。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P2-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P2-S4",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "To those who are unaware that animal research was needed to produce these treatments, as well as new treatments and vaccines, animal research seems wasteful at best and cruel at worst.",
    "translation": "对于那些不知道需要动物研究来生产这些治疗方法以及新疗法和疫苗的人来说，动物研究往好里说是浪费，往坏里说是残酷的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P2-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P2-S5",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Much can be done.",
    "translation": "可以做很多事情。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P3-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P3-S1",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Scientists could \"adopt\" middle school classes and present their own research.",
    "translation": "科学家可以“采用”中学课程并展示他们自己的研究。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P3-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P3-S2",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "They should be quick to respond to letters to the editor, lest animal rights misinformation go unchallenged and acquire a deceptive appearance of truth.",
    "translation": "他们应该迅速回复给编辑的信，以免动物权利的错误信息不受质疑，并获得具有欺骗性的真相。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P3-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P3-S3",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Research institutions could be opened to tours, to show that laboratory animals receive humane care.",
    "translation": "研究机构可以开放参观，以表明实验动物受到人道关怀。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P3-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P3-S4",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Finally, because the ultimate stakeholders are patients, the health research community should actively recruit to its cause not only well-known personalities such as Stephen Cooper, who has made courageous statements about the value of animal research, but all who receive medical treatment.",
    "translation": "最后，由于最终的利益相关者是患者，健康研究界不仅应该积极招募像斯蒂芬·库珀（Stephen Cooper）这样的知名人士来支持其事业，而且还应该招募所有接受治疗的人，斯蒂芬·库珀曾勇敢地阐述了动物研究的价值。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:a4339c3b4ac2fe21fe76d277d97c136c52427a0f0fc6fec1c55b87962e29485c"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P3-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P3-S5",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "If good people do nothing, there is a real possibility that an uninformed citizenry will extinguish the precious embers of medical progress.",
    "translation": "如果好人不采取任何行动，不知情的公民很可能会扑灭医学进步的宝贵余烬。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2003.js",
      "year": 2003,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2003-r-t2",
